OL,3,CRicky Hatton's life to be honoured
OL,4,Cwith statue
OL,6,FA statue in memory of boxing champion
OL,7,FRicky Hatton will be built in his home
OL,8,Ftown.
OL,10,FThe World Champion boxer, 46, was
OL,11,Ffound unresponsive at his home in
OL,12,FHyde, Greater Manchester, by his
OL,13,Fmanager on 14 September 2025.
OL,15,FAn inquest into his death in March
OL,16,Ffound it was not clear that he
OL,17,Fintended to take his own life.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
