FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791391695
OL,3,CRicky Hatton's life to be honoured
OL,4,Cwith statue
OL,6,FThe coroner's court heard the former
OL,7,Fboxer, known to fans as "The Hitman",
OL,8,Fwas in good spirits and, despite past
OL,9,Ftroubles with alcohol and drugs, had
OL,10,Fbeen the best "in years".
OL,12,FFollowing his death an online petition
OL,13,Fto build a statue in his honour was
OL,14,Fsigned by more than 9,000 people, and
OL,15,Fhis parents also added their voices to
OL,16,Fthe growing calls.
OL,26,@rD@OOUrD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
