PN,36103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791391695
OL,3,CRicky Hatton's life to be honoured
OL,4,Cwith statue
OL,6,FIn an exclusive interview with ITV
OL,7,FGranada Reports, Ricky's dad Ray said:
OL,8,F"That would be nice. Whether it was
OL,9,Fblue or red, it made no difference. He
OL,10,Fwas a Mancunian."
OL,12,FWhile his mum Carol added: "I don't
OL,13,Fneed a statue to remember him. None of
OL,14,Fthe family do. But he brought a lot of
OL,15,Fpride to Manchester and it would be a
OL,16,Ffitting tribute to my boy."
OL,18,FNow politicians in Tameside have
OL,19,Fbacked the idea.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
