CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791391695
OL,3,CRicky Hatton's life to be honoured
OL,4,Cwith statue
OL,6,FIn a motion, tabled at the latest town
OL,7,Fhall meeting by Allan Hopwood, leader
OL,8,Fof Reform in the area, he called for
OL,9,Fit to be built in either Hyde town
OL,10,Fcentre or Hattersley ` where Hatton
OL,11,Fgrew up.
OL,13,FCllr Hopwood said: "Some people in
OL,14,Fthis chamber may already know, but
OL,15,Ftoday, October 6, would have been
OL,16,FRicky Hatton's 48th birthday.
OL,26,@uD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
