PN,36105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791391695
OL,3,CRicky Hatton's life to be honoured
OL,4,Cwith statue
OL,6,F"Ricky was a proud son of Tameside
OL,7,Fwhose achievements in boxing and
OL,8,Fcommunity engagement have inspired
OL,9,Fmany people, young and old, across
OL,10,FTameside and far beyond.
OL,12,F"I knew Ricky personally and I boxed
OL,13,Fwith him at the same venue when he was
OL,14,Fa schoolboy. I knew he was special
OL,15,Fthen and I've watched him over the
OL,16,Fyears."
OL,26,@tD@AOUxD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791391695
OL,3,CRicky Hatton's life to be honoured
OL,4,Cwith statue
OL,6,FHe said the project would be funded
OL,7,Fthrough fundraisers and not cost the
OL,8,Ftown hall a penny, adding that the
OL,9,Fcommunity would also be included in
OL,10,Fthe design creation for the statue.
OL,12,FBut, the Local Democracy Service
OL,13,Freports, when the Labour leadership
OL,14,Fattempted to change the motion to
OL,15,Finclude another iconic Hyde athlete,
OL,16,Fmarathon runner Ron Hill, it sparked
OL,17,Ftension in the chamber.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791391695
OL,3,CRicky Hatton's life to be honoured
OL,4,Cwith statue
OL,6,FCouncil leader Eleanor Wills said the
OL,7,Fchanges would see the statues for both
OL,8,Fathletes brought into a strategic plan
OL,9,Fso they could ensure the projects are
OL,10,Fproperly funded.
OL,12,FShe pointed out that the former Mayor
OL,13,Fof Greater Manchester, now Prime
OL,14,FMinister Andy Burnham, vowed to create
OL,15,Fa statue and there were plans already
OL,16,Fin motion to do it.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791391695
OL,3,CRicky Hatton's life to be honoured
OL,4,Cwith statue
OL,6,FCllr Leanne Feeley added: "We don't
OL,7,Fdisagree with the motion to create a
OL,8,Fstatue, sculpture or piece of artwork
OL,9,Ffor Ricky Hatton. But we also want to
OL,10,Fcommemorate Ron Hill, who is also a
OL,11,Fsignificant figure."
OL,13,FBut opposition councillors disagreed
OL,14,Fwith the addition. Cllr Ged Cooney
OL,15,Fcalled the grouping of the statues
OL,16,Finto one project 'unnecessary'.
OL,18,FThe Labour amendment to the original
OL,19,Fmotion failed, as the group was
OL,20,Foutvoted.
OL,26,@nD@[OUsD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791391695
OL,3,CRicky Hatton's life to be honoured
OL,4,Cwith statue
OL,6,FCllr Hopwood added: "He is a legend in
OL,7,Fthis part of the world and we should
OL,8,Frecognise him. We shouldn't be coming
OL,9,Fback with silly amendments. We should
OL,10,Fjust get on and get it done."
OL,12,FThe original motion was unanimously
OL,13,Fapproved, which means the council has
OL,14,Fcommitted to bringing forward the
OL,15,Fcreation of a statue for the champion
OL,16,Fboxer.
OL,26,@nD@UOUrD@]O]
